+### Normal-fp32 direct axis sums
+
+| Coverage | Result |
+|---|---:|
+| unchanged `TestOps.test_sum_tiny` | pass |
+| unchanged `test_sum` + `test_sum_dtype_arg` | **2 passed in 10.06s** |
